  "There is no datetime column. If there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.": "There is no datetime column. If there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.",
  "Since there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.": "Since there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.",
  "K sep type notification": "Kiểu dữ liệu của số thực hoặc số nguyên có chứa dấu phân cách hàng ngàn, hãy thay đổi kiểu dữ liệu cho đúng.",
  "Preview same value message": "There are columns with the same values in the previewed data. Please check whether it is set as the target column to import data.",
  "Preview null value message": "There are columns with no values in the previewed data. If you want to set the target column to import data, please check and specify the appropriate data type.",
  "Dummy Datetime Generate On DS Confirm Message": "The target file does not have a datetime column.\nThe system requires datetime, so are you sure to generate dummy datetime(DatetimeDummy) and continue setting?\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.\n* Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.\n* Recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n* For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n",
  "Dummy Datetime Generate On Proc Confirm Message": "Dummy datetime (DatetimeDummy) was generated because there is no datetime column in the target file.\n\nPlease check the generated dummy datetime and import it with \"As Datetime\" checked.\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.\n* Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.\n* Recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n* For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n",
  "Anchor cursor": "Anchor cursor",
  "Show  cursor from all labels": "Show  cursor from all labels",
  "Hide cursor": "Hide cursor",
  "The target file does not have a datetime column. Please prepare a datetime column or consider using dummy datetime (DatetimeDummy).": "There is no datetime column. If there is no datetime column, the application generates a dummy data for datetime.",
  "MSP Hide Contour MSG": "Since the number of data points drawn on one graph is large, a high-speed mode scatter plot with contour is drawn.If you want to plot all data points, please change the target period to reduce the number of data points.",
